### CATEGORY - Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Thiết bị nhà bếp REST",
  "description": "Danh mục test bằng REST Client"
}

### CATEGORY - List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories?page=1&limit=10&search=bếp&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### CATEGORY - Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### CATEGORY - Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Thiết bị bếp gia đình REST",
  "description": "Cập nhật danh mục test"
}

### CATEGORY - Soft delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### CATEGORY - Restore
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

