### CUSTOMER - Create by CASHIER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn An REST",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "email": "an.rest@example.com",
  "address": "Quận 3, TP. Hồ Chí Minh"
}

### CUSTOMER - List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers?page=1&limit=10&search=An&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}

### CUSTOMER - Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}

### CUSTOMER - Update by ADMIN
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn An REST Updated",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "email": "an.rest.updated@example.com",
  "address": "Quận 10, TP. Hồ Chí Minh",
  "points": 0
}

### CUSTOMER - Soft delete by ADMIN
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### CUSTOMER - Restore by ADMIN
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### USER - Create cashier by ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Cashier REST",
  "email": "cashier.rest@homex.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "CASHIER"
}

### USER - List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=1&limit=10&role=CASHIER&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### USER - Change password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "newPassword": "123456789"
}
